OL,3,CManchester City lodge appeal against
OL,4,Cguilty verdict
OL,6,FManchester City have officially
OL,7,Fappealed against the damning judgment
OL,8,Fthat found the club guilty of
OL,9,Fbreaching Premier League financial
OL,10,Frules.
OL,12,FThe appeal comes just days after an
OL,13,Findependent commission released a
OL,14,Fdetailed report outlining City's
OL,15,Falleged misconduct.
OL,17,FThe club, which had until Friday 2
OL,18,FOctober to file its appeal, confirmed
OL,19,Fon Thursday 1 October that it had
OL,20,Fsubmitted a comprehensive challenge to
OL,21,Fthe findings.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
