OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791485298
OL,3,CManchester City lodge appeal against
OL,4,Cguilty verdict
OL,6,FIn a statement posted on the club's
OL,7,Fwebsite, Manchester City asserted
OL,8,Ftheir innocence. It criticised the
OL,9,Fcommission's verdict, describing it as
OL,10,Fcontaining "clear material errors of
OL,11,Flaw, principle and fact, and is
OL,12,Funsafe."
OL,14,FThe statement said: "Manchester City
OL,15,FFootball Club can confirm that, at 7pm
OL,16,Fon Thursday 1st October 2026, the club
OL,17,Flodged its comprehensive appeal
OL,18,Fagainst the opinion of the Premier
OL,19,FLeague commission, in relation to the
OL,20,FPremier League disciplinary matter.
OL,26,@rD@LOUtD@HO]vD@UOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
