OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791485298
OL,3,CManchester City lodge appeal against
OL,4,Cguilty verdict
OL,6,F"The club is innocent of the
OL,7,Faccusations made by the Premier League
OL,8,Fand a comprehensive body of
OL,9,Firrefutable evidence exists in support
OL,10,Fof all of its positions relating to
OL,11,Fthis case.
OL,13,F"We will continue to respect due
OL,14,Fprocess and are necessarily restricted
OL,15,Fin what we can say further until all
OL,16,Fproceedings are complete."
OL,26,@xD@ZO]
