OL,3,CManchester City lodge appeal against
OL,4,Cguilty verdict
OL,6,FThe original commission concluded that
OL,7,Fmore than #830 million of such funding
OL,8,Fwas used to inflate the club's
OL,9,Frevenues, enabling compliance with
OL,10,FPremier League and UEFA financial
OL,11,Fregulations through a series of "sham"
OL,12,Farrangements.
OL,14,FCentral to City's appeal is the
OL,15,Fargument that government funding via
OL,16,Fthe Abu Dhabi Crown Prince Court (CPC)
OL,17,Fprovided assistance to sponsors in
OL,18,Fmeeting their financial obligations to
OL,19,Fthe club.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
