OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791485298
OL,3,CManchester City lodge appeal against
OL,4,Cguilty verdict
OL,6,FThe commission, however, dismissed
OL,7,Fthis explanation as "untrue," claiming
OL,8,Fit was a narrative constructed after
OL,9,Fthe fact to conceal the true source of
OL,10,Fthe funds, which they allege
OL,11,Foriginated from the club's owner,
OL,12,FSheikh Mansour's Abu Dhabi United
OL,13,FGroup (ADUG).
OL,15,FWith City's appeal confirmed, the case
OL,16,Fis set to continue for some time.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, the Football Association
OL,19,Fhas indicated it is reviewing the
OL,20,Fcommission's findings and could take
OL,21,Findependent action if deemed necessary.
