OL,3,CManchester City lodge appeal against
OL,4,Cguilty verdict
OL,6,FA statement from the FA said: "The
OL,7,Findependent commission's decision has
OL,8,Fsignificant implications for the
OL,9,Fintegrity of the game. We are
OL,10,Fcarefully considering the decision and
OL,11,Fits implications and will take action
OL,12,Fwhere appropriate.
OL,14,F"As proceedings between the Premier
OL,15,FLeague and Manchester City Football
OL,16,FClub remain ongoing, we do not intend
OL,17,Fto comment further at this stage. We
OL,18,Fwill, however, continue to monitor
OL,19,Fdevelopments closely."
