OL,3,CManchester City lodge appeal against
OL,4,Cguilty verdict
OL,6,FThe outcome of City's appeal could
OL,7,Fhave far-reaching consequences for
OL,8,Fboth the club and the wider landscape
OL,9,Fof English football, as questions of
OL,10,Ffinancial regulation and sporting
OL,11,Fintegrity continue to dominate the
OL,12,Fagenda.
